---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — ThaiKeto"
  description="ThaiKeto affiliate disclosure. How we earn commissions and our commitment to honest recommendations."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-display font-semibold text-primary mb-8">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <div class="prose-thai">
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
        Transparency is important to us. This page explains how ThaiKeto makes money and how that affects our content.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Earn Money</h2>
      <p>
        ThaiKeto participates in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.
      </p>

      <h2>What This Means for You</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>When you click an Amazon link on our site and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission.</li>
        <li>This commission comes at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>.</li>
        <li>The price you pay is exactly the same whether you use our link or go directly to Amazon.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>
        We only recommend products we genuinely believe in. Our product roundups are based on research, testing, and honest assessment — never on which product pays the highest commission. If we wouldn't recommend it to a friend, we won't recommend it to you.
      </p>

      <h2>Other Affiliate Programs</h2>
      <p>
        In the future, we may join additional affiliate programs. This page will be updated to reflect any new partnerships. All affiliate relationships will be disclosed here.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about our affiliate relationships, contact us at hello@thaiketo.com.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
